{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the existing plugin dispatch-order contract.** `PluginRunner` previously documented and implemented registration-order dispatch for every hook. Reversing `onInvocationEnd` changes observable behavior for existing multi-plugin configurations and can invert established flush or cleanup dependencies. Retain registration order, or introduce an explicit opt-in LIFO scope mechanism.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77Qxmd","finding_digest":"228b02e451d041f1350baeb06c1087e868a78673c95bfbe462221502988bf67c","finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":112,"observation_digest":"b7548f9002f7bc1f70dbc97017aaae2d5f2a0bdd231b929376a08ecbd55a48d5","observation_id":"aro_v1_w5ki7eac666b64g3zfybpkvofv","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","published_at":"2026-10-08T06:10:26Z","review_id":"arr_v1_u5vqjkgdlfisimzhmtii6vlizn","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"7adb5a65e5e91e736325ca7e73781e22bfcf8a7e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_a7qcg3yh4ddcwag5ou6zkfjknm","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T06:10:26Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
